The reviewer skills in this folder (review-structure, review-style, review-clarity, review-design,
review-readiness, review-technical-detail, review-simplicity) are adapted from the Goldfish reviewer agents of
the Elephant-Goldfish Model (EGM), https://github.com/google/elephant-goldfish-model,
Copyright Google LLC, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Changes: each reviewer is rewritten as a SKILL.md for this platform's review loop (FR-SDLC-004). Reviewers
receive one document and the evidence the workflow permits, never the drafting conversation; they return
findings as JSON with a severity, a location, the problem and a suggested change; the brainstorming mode, the
file-based workflow and the tool instructions of the originals are left out.
